  "thag1.6:1.1": "6 yo sītavanaṃ upāgā bhikkhu ",
  "thag1.6:1.2": "eko santusito samāhitatto ",
  "thag1.6:1.3": "vijitāvi apetalomahaṃso ",
  "thag1.6:1.4": "rakkhaṃ kāyagatāsatiṃ dhītimāti. ",
  "thag1.6:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sītavaniyo thero. "
}
